  "description": "Mergeable, deterministic distinct-count (approximate COUNT DISTINCT) over managed streams: an exact small-N fast path that promotes to a fixed ~16 KB HyperLogLog past a threshold, plus a removable Cuckoo dedup filter for windowed exact-ish deduplication. Generic over the caller's key type and a zero-cost inlined Celerity hasher, with cross-shard merge that is byte-identical across runtimes. Built on Celerity.Collections.",
